# DokuWiki recipe: permission-normaliser exceptions (slice 6B
# flag 1). Read by the app container's init after its uniform
# pass, and applied by onionhost-recipe itself after an apply
# and after the install hook; format:
#   <octal mode> <path relative to the app-data volume>
# users.auth.php holds every member's password hash and
# local.php is the owner's own configuration (it can carry
# sensitive settings for auth plugins). The uniform pass would
# leave both group-shared at 0664; the recipe keeps them at
# 0660 - still writable by the application (DokuWiki runs as
# the files' owner) and manageable by the owner through the
# owner group, but never readable by other accounts on the host.
0660 www/conf/users.auth.php
0660 www/conf/local.php
